+## Deploy (macOS, local)
+
+- The user's daily-driver app is **`/Applications/Ghostty Dev.app`**
+  (bundle id `com.mitchellh.ghostty.dev`, executable `ghostty`), NOT
+  `/Applications/Ghostty.app`. Always deploy local builds there.
+- Deploy by copying the freshly built executable over the Dev one:
+  `cp zig-out/Ghostty.app/Contents/MacOS/ghostty "/Applications/Ghostty Dev.app/Contents/MacOS/ghostty"`
+  (preserves the Dev bundle's identity/Info.plist), then re-sign ad-hoc:
+  `codesign --force --sign - "/Applications/Ghostty Dev.app"`.
+- The user must fully **Cmd+Q and relaunch** for changes to take effect;
+  the running process keeps the old in-memory binary even after the file
+  on disk is replaced.
+
 ## libghostty-vt
 
 - Build: `zig build -Demit-lib-vt`
